{
  "info": {
    "name": "Restaurant API (Dastarkhwan) - Sikander Hayat 9315",
    "description": "Assignment 2 API tests. Run 'Auth' first so the tokens are saved, then the other folders. Set baseUrl to http://localhost:5000/api (or your laptop IP).",
